# HUSK's M0 determinism script, as tests/determinism.rs runs it: thirty
# stalkers a-move across the walled test map, then a second leg and a
# shift-queued third. Flow fields, separation, arrival propagation, queueing.
# THE GATE: the port holds this tick for tick before anything else counts.
seed 7
ticks 10000
setup m0
0 point units=0-29 attack=1 x=38.0 y=38.0 queued=0
3500 point units=0-29 attack=0 x=-38.0 y=25.0 queued=0
3500 point units=0-29 attack=0 x=30.0 y=-35.0 queued=1
